title: zenodo-uploader
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Moritz
    family-names: Mähr
    email: moritz.maehr@gmail.com
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1367-1618'
    affiliation: University of Bern
repository-code: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
url: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
abstract: >-
  Mirror DOIs and upload records to Zenodo from the command line. Fetches metadata
  from DataCite (falling back to Crossref), maps it onto Zenodo deposit metadata,
  attaches files, and creates or publishes depositions via the Zenodo REST API.
keywords:
  - zenodo
  - doi
  - datacite
  - open-science
  - research-data
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.1.0
